subckt dut (VDD VSS VB1 Vout)
C1 (net0 net1) capacitor c=1p
L1 (VDD Vout) inductor l=1n
M1 (Vout VB1 net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RB (net0 VSS) resistor r=1k
RS (net1 net2) resistor r=1k
VIN (net2 VSS) vsource dc=1
